Usage ≥ 28; Ast/TO Ratio ≥ 1.25; Steal % ≥ 2.25; Free Throw % ≥ 0.84;
10 players: Jones, T.J. Carter, Tariq Francis, Damian Lillard, Jimmer Fredette, Sean Singletary, Stephen Curry, Wade Taylor IV, Mikel Brown Jr., Trae Young, and Cooper Flagg. 

Jones is the 3rd-best rebounder, 2nd-best BLK%, lowest TOV%. An outlier among outliers. There's likely more primary handler upside than he's tapped into so far, due to his TOV aversion and low 3PAr for his touch level; we get him here, and he gets comfortable three-hunting as a P&R handler, and he'd be a functionally 6'4 Wade Taylor IV variant.
